@Catalog.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5055

### Health
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Tenants
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants
Accept: application/json

### Categories
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/categories?tenantId=t1
Accept: application/json

### Products (PLP / card)
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/products?tenantId=t1&categoryId=cat_kan&includeSubtree=true&view=card&page=1&pageSize=24
Accept: application/json

### Facet options
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/facet-options?tenantId=t1&categoryId=cat_silk&includeSubtree=true
Accept: application/json

###
